<title>أخبار مسك الختام</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:'Cairo',Tahoma;background:#f2f2f2;}
header{background:black;min-height:150px;position:relative;color:white;text-align:center;padding:10px;}
